    "detailed_description": "Shush&quot; is an immersive survival game set in a world ravaged by environmental disasters. Join the ranks of the &quot;Waste Warriors&quot; employed by the recycling company &quot;Sunny Smiles&quot; and venture into the forest to gather trash and bring it to the revolutionary &quot;Eco-Collector&quot; machine. But as you delve deeper, mysterious occurrences and sabotage from the rival corporation &quot;Black Harvest&quot; reveal a dark secret lurking within the Eco-Collector. Navigate treacherous terrain, gather resources, and uncover the truth behind Sunny Smiles' sinister creation to survive and expose the monstrous reality hidden within the machine. Will you be a hero of truth or another victim of the Eco-Collector's insatiable hunger?",
    "about_the_game": "Shush&quot; is an immersive survival game set in a world ravaged by environmental disasters. Join the ranks of the &quot;Waste Warriors&quot; employed by the recycling company &quot;Sunny Smiles&quot; and venture into the forest to gather trash and bring it to the revolutionary &quot;Eco-Collector&quot; machine. But as you delve deeper, mysterious occurrences and sabotage from the rival corporation &quot;Black Harvest&quot; reveal a dark secret lurking within the Eco-Collector. Navigate treacherous terrain, gather resources, and uncover the truth behind Sunny Smiles' sinister creation to survive and expose the monstrous reality hidden within the machine. Will you be a hero of truth or another victim of the Eco-Collector's insatiable hunger?",
